                The Reolink Argus 4 Pro is our overall pick — 4K, a 180-degree view, on-device detection, and local recording with no subscription. For local AI and the best night colour, the eufyCam S3 Pro is excellent. If you want the most accurate alerts and Google Home integration, choose the Nest Cam; if you want continuous 24/7 recording, a wired PoE system like the Lorex is the only real answer.
