            <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-100 rounded-2xl p-6">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-red-900 mt-0 mb-2">Buying 1080p for Long Distances</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">
                A 1080p camera watching a driveway gives you a person-shaped blur and an unreadable plate. Decide what you need to recognise and how far away it is before choosing resolution — and do not pay for 4K on an indoor camera watching a hallway.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-100 rounded-2xl p-6">
